# wrangler assets exclusion list (Cloudflare Workers static assets).
#
# This portal is a plain static site: only the files a visitor loads may be
# published. Without this file wrangler falls back to .gitignore, which does
# NOT list .git/ (nobody gitignores it) and does not know that doc/,
# scripts/, tests/ or the agent skill folders are internal. The result was
# that apptonomia.uk served the whole repository: /.git/index, /CLAUDE.md,
# /doc/en/spec.md and /scripts/*.js all answered 200.
#
# Calculia already had this file; the metaproject did not. Keep the two in
# sync when a new top-level folder appears: the test is simple — would a
# visitor ever need this file to use the portal? If not, it goes below.
.wrangler/
.git/
.claude/
.github/
.agents/
.codex/
node_modules/
graphify-out*/
graphify-out-meta/
.graphifyignore
.dev/
scripts/
doc/
tests/
test-results/
playwright-report/
_mojibake_test/
.assetsignore
/*.md
/*.log
package.json
package-lock.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
yarn.lock
playwright.config.js
/wrangler.toml
/serve.js
/_o.txt
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.key
**/credentials.json
**/service-account*.json
